<i>what he was telling you or no?</i>

351
00:30:08,340 --> 00:30:10,375
<i>PSYCHIATRIST (ON TAPE):</i>
<i>No, I can't tell you that.</i>

352
00:30:10,441 --> 00:30:13,007
