<i>You mean a diagnosis?</i>

354
00:30:14,907 --> 00:30:16,274
<i>PSYCHIATRIST (ON TAPE):</i>
<i>I know that's</i>

355
00:30:16,341 --> 00:30:17,740
<i>what you're after,</i>

356
00:30:17,806 --> 00:30:19,973
<i>but a diagnosis is not always</i>
<i>as helpful as you might think.</i>

357
00:30:20,040 --> 00:30:21,641
<i>MOTHER (ON TAPE):</i>
<i>You don't have one?</i>

358
00:30:21,706 --> 00:30:22,907
