<i>looking inside ♪</i>

455
00:37:39,008 --> 00:37:41,908
SASHA: Whoa.
MOTHER: Mm-hmm.

456
00:37:45,107 --> 00:37:46,407
Yeah.

457
00:37:50,274 --> 00:37:53,474
And...

458
00:37:53,541 --> 00:37:56,240
we are putting it here.

459
