488
00:40:37,706 --> 00:40:40,240
MOTHER:
Hey. Hey, hey, hey, hey.

489
00:40:42,274 --> 00:40:44,574
FATHER:
Devil got into you?

490
00:40:44,641 --> 00:40:46,407
